<title>SRI LANKA: CRICKET-SRI LANKA BEAT INDIA IN ASIA CUP.</title>
<headline>CRICKET-SRI LANKA BEAT INDIA IN ASIA CUP.</headline>
<dateline>COLOMBO 1997-07-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Sri Lanka defeated India by six wickets in their Asia Cup match on Friday.</p>
<p>Scores: India 227-6 innings (50 overs) closed (M.Azharuddin 81, R.Dravid 69); Sri Lanka 231-4 in 44.4 overs.</p>
